<title>NIGERIA: Nigerian Avon Crowncaps net profit rises.</title>
<headline>Nigerian Avon Crowncaps net profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full year result to end-March 1996 of Avon Crowncaps Nigeria Plc. (In million naira unless stated)</p>
<p>				  1996	    1995</p>
<p> Turnover		    1,600   vs    1,500</p>
<p> Profit before taxation    135.0 vs	141.3</p>
<p> Taxation			 11.5 vs	 47.7</p>
<p> Profit after taxation     123.5 vs	 93.6</p>
<p>NOTE - The company is proposing a dividend of 17.5 kobo per share and a one-for-four scrip issue. Closure of register: Nov 22 - Nov 27, 1996.</p>
<p>($1=80 naira)</p>
<p>-- Lagos newsroom +234 1 263 03 17</p>
